  offerLine: I know all the spots. All of them. There's so many. Take me out a few times and I'll show you where the good dirt is.
  activeLine: Three trips, and I'll show you everything. Take me foraging!
  readyLine: See? Good dirt. Look what I dug up while you weren't watching. It's for your cafe. I don't know why it's so big.
  doneLine: There's one more smell I've been meaning to find.
